div></summary><div class="sc-eudKmy ffUBTa pf-90_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-flFjkU kahMgJ pf-91_"><p class="sc-bhqpXc fHzOVK pf-92_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-14df2ba9-14cc-4417-be0e-43e97120995e"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">No, non è previsto nessun rimborso.</span></p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-eeFoZL bguFnT pf-95_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-crvJBB jZphKJ pf-96_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-pf-anchor="La musicassetta è nominale, al momento del check out dovrai inserire i dati della persona che si recherà fisicamente all’evento a ritirarla." data-header-id="c3e7e6e6-1407-4068-9f18-6b2f9354f028" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>Voglio regalare la musicassetta, che dati personali deve inserire?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-eudKmy ffUBTa pf-98_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-flFjkU kahMgJ pf-99_"><p class="sc-bhqpXc fHzOVK pf-100_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-8c044640-a5c7-402d-a905-2113912a7c6f"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">La musicassetta è nominale, al momento del check out dovrai inserire i dati della persona che si recherà fisicamente all’evento a ritirarla.</span></p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-eeFoZL bguFnT pf-103_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-crvJBB jZphKJ pf-104_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="919f03ca-5857-424b-967e-2bb6b9eae22f" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>Posso delegare qualcun altro per il ritiro?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-eudKmy ffUBTa pf-106_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-flFjkU kahMgJ pf-107_"><p class="sc-bhqpXc fHzOVK pf-108_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-5857124b-967e-4bb6-b9ea-e22f01a125d5"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Puoi effettuare un cambio di nominativo scrivendo a “mail”. </span></p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-eeFoZL bguFnT pf-111_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-crvJBB jZphKJ pf-112_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-pf-anchor="Può essere effettuato solo un acquisto per persona. L’acquisto è nominale, quindi al momento del checkout ti verranno richiesti tutti i dati personali. Se vuoi acquistare più di una cassetta dovrai procedere facendo altri singoli ordini con nominativo diverso." data-header-id="2f8fedd2-d50b-47bc-a2a1-63027730b793" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>Posso acquistare più di una musicassetta?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-eudKmy ffUBTa pf-114_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-flFjkU kahMgJ pf-115_"><p class="sc-bhqpXc fHzOVK pf-116_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-0fd22dad-fdaf-4b6f-b86b-89bacd96abab"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Può essere effettuato solo un acquisto per persona. L’acquisto è nominale, quindi al momento del checkout ti verranno richiesti tutti i dati personali. Se vuoi acquistare più di una cassetta dovrai procedere facendo altri singoli ordini con nominativo diverso.</span></p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-eeFoZL bguFnT pf-119_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-crvJBB jZphKJ pf-120_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="01a125d5-fd1e-45e0-8381-1c13dba203d1" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span></span></div></summary><div class="sc-eudKmy ffUBTa pf-122_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-flFjkU kahMgJ pf-123_"><p class="sc-bhqpXc fHzOVK pf-124_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-fd1e45e0-4381-4c13-9ba2-03d1b94360cb"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">No, a ogni data corrisponde l’acquisto di una musicassetta, quella bianca ti garantisce